    <string name="import_guide_text">1. Prepare lines in this format:\nTitle | ANIME | 2024-01-01 | 5 | comment\n\n2. If your list is unstructured, ask ChatGPT to convert it to this format.\n\n3. Copy the formatted lines into the import field.\n\n4. One line = one entry.</string>
    <string name="import_prompt_text">Convert my watch list to this format:\nTitle | ANIME/MOVIE/SERIES | YYYY-MM-DD | rating 0-5 | comment\n\nRules:\n- one line per entry\n- use ANIME for anime, MOVIE for movies, SERIES for series\n- use dates in YYYY-MM-DD format\n- rating must be between 0 and 5\n- leave comment empty when none is provided\n- output only the formatted lines, without explanations</string>
    <string name="import_example_text">Naruto | ANIME | 2024-01-01 | 5 |\nYour Name | MOVIE | 2024-02-10 | 5 | favorite\nBreaking Bad | SERIES | 2024-03-15 | 5 | rewatch</string>
